<title>USA: Municipal sales total $3.9 bln for week of Dec 2.</title>
<headline>Municipal sales total $3.9 bln for week of Dec 2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $3.9 billion in 153 offerings for the week of Dec 2, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales total $1.7 billion in 105 issues. The largest issue is a $320 million Los Angeles Harbor Department deal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales total $2.2 billion in 48 offerings for the week.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
